    "把文件拖到屏幕上方就能挂上 · 拷贝的文件和图片会自动挂上": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag files to the top of the screen to hang them · Copied files and images are hung automatically"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
